# Build outputs. `cerbero package` writes these into the checkout, so a plain
# `git add -A` sweeps them in; the devel tarball alone is 130 MB and GitHub
# refuses anything over 100 MB. The tarballs belong in an artefact archive
# with their BUILD_INFO beside them, not in git.
/*.tar.xz
/*.tar.xz.BUILD_INFO
